        <detaileddescription>
<para>The default forwards to <ref refid="classNeoN_1_1finiteVolume_1_1cellCentred_1_1volumeBoundary_1_1Processor_1acddc8a16b88357f15b6d23ba311be523" kindref="member">correctBoundaryCondition()</ref>, so a BC that does not implement the <ref refid="classNeoN_1_1finiteVolume_1_1cellCentred_1_1volumeBoundary_1_1Processor_1ae75156de63ab4641655cba60c773c651" kindref="member">set()</ref>/update() split keeps its previous behaviour (full correction every iteration). BCs that split move only the per-iteration work here and the one-time work into <ref refid="classNeoN_1_1finiteVolume_1_1cellCentred_1_1volumeBoundary_1_1Processor_1ae75156de63ab4641655cba60c773c651" kindref="member">set()</ref>. </para>
